                <pb facs="0238" n="142" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg142"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-06-08"><hi rendition="#italic">June 8, 1900</hi></date>.
                        (Received June 11.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Paotingfu missionaries safe up to the present. Chinese Government has sent troops
                    and promises ample protection, but this does not insure permanent safety.
                    Impossible to send foreign relief from forces now here.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
